# The Zeruhn Report (Bastok 1-1): section 1's other checks, by two chars (Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Main, a
# level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria: Cleades: section 1 fails (not Bastok): his script's 1003. bob, a level 10 Warrior of
# Bastok with A Geological Survey current (a GM): Cleades: 1-1's section 1 fails (a current mission), section 2 too
# (not 1-1); 1-2's own section answers (ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 3, 6540).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char bob zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey current
login
trigger Cleades                         # not Bastok: no section: his script's 1003
finish
bob: login
bob: trigger Cleades                    # a current mission (1-2): no 1-1 section: 1-2's 6540
